{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1763736,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"Cryovault 2026 CTF","festival_id":null,"organization_id":119857,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-09-30T12:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-10T09:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/cryovault-2026-pes-university-pesu-bengaluru-1763736","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Greetings from C-ISFCR, PES University!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We are excited to announce <strong>CRYOVAULT 2026 &ndash; A National-Level Capture The Flag (CTF)<\/strong> Competition, bringing together cybersecurity enthusiasts to test their skills, solve challenging problems, and compete in an intense cybersecurity showdown.<\/p>\n<p>Get ready to <em>think, exploit, investigate, and capture the flag<\/em> through hands-on challenges designed to test your technical skills, problem-solving ability, and cybersecurity knowledge.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Structure:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>CRYOVAULT 2026 will be conducted in <strong>two rounds<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &ndash; Online CTF:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Date:<\/strong> 10 - 11 October 2026<br \/><strong>Duration:<\/strong> 10 AM - 10 AM IST<\/p>\n<p>Participants will compete online through a series of cybersecurity challenges. At the end of Round 1, the <strong>Top 45 teams<\/strong> will qualify for the final round.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &ndash; Offline Finale:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Date:<\/strong> 24 - 25 October 2026<br \/><strong>Venue:<\/strong> PESU 52, GJBC, PES University<br \/><strong>Duration:<\/strong> 24 Hours<\/p>\n<p>The <strong>Top 45 qualifiers<\/strong> from the online round will battle it out in the offline finale at PES University for the ultimate CRYOVAULT 2026 championship.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Team Size:<\/strong> 1-3 members<br \/><strong>Prize Pool:<\/strong> \u20b91 Lakh +<\/p>\n<p><em>Top <strong>20 teams<\/strong> from the finale will be awarded a cash prize.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><strong>Challenge Categories:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants can expect challenges across areas such as:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Web Security<\/li>\n<li>Cryptography<\/li>\n<li>Digital Forensics<\/li>\n<li>Reverse Engineering<\/li>\n<li>PWN \/ Binary Exploitation<\/li>\n<li>And more!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate?:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Put your cybersecurity skills to the ultimate test<\/li>\n<li>Solve hands-on, real-world inspired challenges<\/li>\n<li>Strengthen your technical and problem-solving skills<\/li>\n<li>Compete with cybersecurity enthusiasts from across the country<\/li>\n<li>Qualify for an intense offline CTF finale<\/li>\n<li>Win exciting cash prizes, goodies, and recognition<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Gather your team, sharpen your skills, and get ready for 24 hours of challenges, strategy, and cybersecurity!<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":28053394,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-30T15:08:24+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T11:55:45+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"iOkBEVe","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":55,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-09-30 17:06:34","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players"